Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e3","summary":"In a flashback, twelve-year-old Torens pickpockets gold in Hanweir and his brother Elamon rescues him.","participants":["torens","elamon"],"location":"hanweir","importance":"minor","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"Elamon snatched the coins and tossed them back at the wealthy man.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=Elamon%20snatched%20the%20coins,at%20the%20wealthy%20man.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=Elamon%20snatched%20the%20coins,at%20the%20wealthy%20man.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e4","summary":"Boris guides Torens to the keep, unlocks the iron door with a brass sphere, and locks them inside along with Aleksandar who followed to repay Torens.","participants":["boris","torens","aleksandar","the-keep"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":82,"quote":"He shut and locked the door behind them.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=He%20shut%20and%20locked%20the%20door%20behind%20them.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","u