her":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=he%20picked%20up%20the,contents%20into%20Elamon%27s%20face","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e7","summary":"Torens finds the shackled prophet Eruth, who says the devils took the boy to their master.","participants":["torens","eruth","devils"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":132,"quote":"\"The devils took the boy to their master.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22The%20devils%20took%20the%20boy%20to%20their%20master.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22The%20devils%20took%20the%20boy%20to%20their%20master.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e8","summary":"Torens frees Eruth, who explains that cathars wanted to execute her for her visions and that the Dark Lady helped her.","participants":["torens","eruth","the-dark-lady","inquisitors"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"minor","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":157,"quote":"\"You're free. Can you walk?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22You%27re%20free.%20Can%20you%20walk%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22You%27re%20free.%20Can%20you%20walk%3F%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e9","summary":"In a flashback, Torens returns to Hanweir to find the entire town gone and reads Elamon's letter too late.","participants":["torens","elamon"],"location":"hanweir","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":172,"quote":"as if the entire town, all at once, had been gouged out of the earth","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=as%20if%20the%20entire,out%20of%20the%20earth","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=as%20if%20the%20entire,out%20of%20the%20earth","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e10","summary":"Torens and Eruth descend through a bone-lined ossuary of captured memories and find Aleksandar's body possessed by Umbris.","participants":["torens","eruth","umbris","aleksandar","devils"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":196,"quote":"\"You may call me Umbris.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22You%20may%20call%20me%20Umbris.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22You%20may%20call%20me%20Umbris.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e11","summary":"Umbris explains that the sorcerer Taivas bound him to take the villagers' sorrows in exchange for tribute victims, and reveals that he took Aleksandar's memory of his sister.","participants":["umbris","taivas","aleksandar","torens"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":204,"quote":"The anguish he felt at discovering the corpse of his young sister is . . . delectable.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=The%20anguish%20he%20felt,.%20.%20.%20delectable.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=The%20anguish%20he%20felt,.%20.%20.%20delectable.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e12","summary":"Umbris tempts Torens to give up his pain and walk away in exchange for purpose and rewards.","participants":["umbris","torens","eruth"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":222,"quote":"\"Allow me to take your pain away and give you purpose.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22Allow%20me%20to%20take,and%20give%20you%20purpose.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22Allow%20me%20to%20take,and%20give%20you%20purpose.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e13","summary":"Torens strikes the binding circle with his mace, freeing Umbris, and then makes a proposal to him.","participants":["torens","umbris","devils"],"location":"the-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":236,"quote":"When the head of the mace met the binding circle, the impact sent a thunderclap pealing throughout the catacomb","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=When%20the%20head%20of,pealing%20throughout%20the%20catacomb","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=When%20the%20head%20of,pealing%20throughout%20the%20catacomb","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e14","summary":"Torens leaves as the townsfolk turn on Vytas and Boris, and Eruth stays to guide them.","participants":["torens","eruth","vytas","boris"],"location":"traublassen","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":245,"quote":"\"I'm staying. These people will need guidance.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22I%27m%20staying.%20These%20people%20will%20need%20guidance.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=%22I%27m%20staying.%20These%20people%20will%20need%20guidance.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"survivors-2021-11-12-e15","summary":"Umbris leaves Aleksandar's body, and Torens comforts the boy as the mob stones Vytas.","participants":["umbris","aleksandar","torens","vytas"],"location":"traublassen","importance":"major","page":"stories/survivors-2021-11-12","order":440,"story_date":"2021-11-12","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":257,"quote":"Umbris relinquished control of Aleksandar, who collapsed into Torens's arms.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=Umbris%20relinquished%20control%20of,collapsed%20into%20Torens%27s%20arms.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Survivors","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Reinhardt Suarez"],"date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survivors-2021-11-12#:~:text=Umbris%20relinquished%20control%20of,collapsed%20into%20Torens%27s%20arms.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Survivors\" by Reinhardt Suarez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"torens-e0","summary":"Torens leaves Hanweir after a final confrontation with his brother.","participants":["torens","elamon"],"location":"hanweir","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/torens","order":1648,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":3,"quote":"he had to leave the town and his sickly mother behind","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Torens#:~:text=he%20had%20to%20leave,his%20sickly%20mother%20behind","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Torens","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Torens","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Torens#:~:text=he%20had%20to%20leave,his%20sickly%20mother%20behind","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Torens\", section \"Origin\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"torens-e1","summary":"Caught scavenging in besieged Thraben, Torens is spared by Odric and made Mausoleum Guard by Thalia.","participants":["torens","odric","thalia"],"location":"thraben","importance":"major","page":"wiki/torens","order":1648,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":4,"quote":"Thalia put Torens to work as Mausoleum Guard .","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Torens#:~:text=Thalia%20put%20Torens%20to,as%20Mausoleum%20Guard%20.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":f